<section id="parallel">
  <h2 id="parallel"><a href="#parallel">Run your system several times at once</a></h2>
  <p>A <strong>universe</strong> is one running copy of your whole system: a git worktree of every repository, containers of its own, volumes of its own, hostnames of its own. Have as many as you like.</p>
  <figure class="fig wide">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 720 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="pt pd">
      <title id="pt">One checkout runs one branch at a time; multiversectl runs three universes side by side</title>
      <desc id="pd">The usual way, drawn greyed out: one checkout per repository, on branch feat/login, with one stack running, while every other branch — main, fix/cart, spike/redis — waits its turn. With multiversectl, three universes side by side, each in colour: universe 1 on feat/login, universe 2 on fix/cart, universe 3 on main. Each holds the same two apps, api and web, and answers on its own two hostnames: api-u1 and app-u1, api-u2 and app-u2, api-u3 and app-u3.</desc>

      <text class="d-h" x="20" y="34">The usual way</text>
      <rect class="d-tint-off" x="20" y="48" width="680" height="152" rx="10"/>
      <svg class="ico" x="44" y="74" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><use href="#i-folder"/></svg>
      <text class="d-t" x="80" y="94">one checkout</text>
      <text class="d-m" x="44" y="132">branch feat/login</text>
      <text class="d-m" x="44" y="168">one stack running</text>
      <path class="d-sep" d="M340 68V180"/>
      <text class="d-m" x="372" y="92">every other branch waits</text>
      <svg class="ico" x="372" y="108" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>
      <text class="d-m" x="404" y="124">main</text>
      <svg class="ico" x="372" y="136" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>
      <text class="d-m" x="404" y="152">fix/cart</text>
      <svg class="ico" x="372" y="164" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>
      <text class="d-m" x="404" y="180">spike/redis</text>

      <text class="d-h" x="20" y="258">With multiversectl</text>
      <g>
        <rect class="d-tint-num" x="20" y="272" width="214" height="228" rx="10"/>
        <text class="d-a" x="36" y="302">universe 1</text>
        <svg class="ico" x="36" y="316" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><use href="#i-git"/></svg>
